TeleHex bundles data derived from Unicode, Inc. sources:

- emoji-test.txt and emoji-data.txt (Unicode Emoji 16.0)
- CLDR annotations for Vietnamese (common/annotations/vi.xml, common/annotationsDerived/vi.xml)

